<title>JAPAN: Shoun says will merge with Seirei on Nov 21.</title>
<headline>Shoun says will merge with Seirei on Nov 21.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shoun Machine Tool Co Ltd said on Friday it would merge with Seirei Industry Co Ltd on November 21.</p>
